Subject: [PATCH] P-009: alias unescaped decode strings

YYJSON_READ_ALIAS_NOESC reads a document with no backslash from the
caller buffer. Strings point at that buffer and str_pool stays NULL.
A buffer that contains a backslash keeps the copying reader.

